        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Flower Shop is a dating and farming simulation game.\n\nSteve's life has just taken a downward turn. His grades from his first semester in college are dismal, his relationship with his girlfriend is rocky at best, and now his dad is shipping him off to some farm for the summer so that he can \"build character.\"\n\nWhat's a poor, lazy, college kid to do?\n\nTake control of Steve as he spends a summer in Fairbook, working on the farm, making new friends, and maintaining old relationships.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Flower Shop es un simulador de citas y granja.\n\nLa vida de Steve acaba de dar un giro para peor. Sus calificaciones del primer semestre en la universidad son pésimas, su relación con su novia es más bien tensa y ahora su padre lo manda a una granja durante el verano para que «forje carácter».\n\n¿Qué puede hacer un estudiante universitario pobre y perezoso?\n\nToma el control de Steve mientras pasa un verano en Fairbrook, trabajando en la granja, haciendo nuevos amigos y manteniendo viejas relaciones.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2010",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
